1) BATSMAN -> CRICKETER -> SPORTSMAN -> FAMOUS PERSON

batsman(sachin).
batsman(virat).
batsman(rohit).
batsman(dhoni).

cricketer(X) :- batsman(X).
sportsman(X) :- cricketer(X).
famous_person(X) :- sportsman(X).

Output:
1 ?- cricketer(sachin).
true.

2 ?- sportsman(virat).
true.

3 ?- famous_person(X).
X = sachin ;
X = virat ;
X = rohit ;
X = dhoni.


